{"parse": {"title": "7TH-09", "pageid": 55146, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-08\" title=\"7TH-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-10\" title=\"7TH-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.8D.E5.8F.AF.E8.B6.85.E8.B6.8A.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"不可超越物\">不可超越物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 不可超越物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Outside the Limits</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>描<span class=\"color-value\"></span>绘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>碰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>触<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>可<span class=\"color-value\"></span>超<span class=\"color-value\"></span>越<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10709</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dixiasuidao\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dixiasuidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dixiasuidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洞穴里映衬着祈祷用的烛光，为净化仪式而作的准备已经结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整数们正在等待着领袖的回归。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>……你们认为37可以通过那个试炼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她压低了声音，将言语中的一丝担忧隐藏了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>谁知道呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210斜靠在岩壁上，百无聊赖地整理着自己头上的葡萄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>6一定是最好过的一关，迷宫里的数字谜题也难不倒我们闪闪发亮的小天才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>最难的是无限定者的诘问——没有人知道问题会是什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>游戏是公平的。在你提出问题之前，必须先回答无限定者的一个问题，这是规则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>倘若你没能回答出来——啊哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210随意地捏爆了手里的葡萄，紫色的汁水溅到了他的手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-510601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">210：</div><div>就会像这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>真恶心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>888摇了摇头，毫不掩饰目光里的嫌弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>我们对此所知甚少，毕竟，已经三个世纪没有人通过仪式了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>失败的代价太过惨痛，很长一段时间，历代的6都禁止教众们参与。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>……不，6在这一点上说谎了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>有人在四年前通过了仪式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个令人惊愕的消息，连210都不禁挺直了腰板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女妖抬起头，望向远处蜡烛映照在岩壁上的火光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>……她们实在是太像了。天赋、思维，连遇到不可跨越的困难时，第一时间想到的解决方案都一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>这的确也是一个难以抗拒的诱惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>假如有一个近在眼前的渠道，通过它，便可以得知一切的真理……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">888：</div><div>有什么理由不去试一试呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光线影影绰绰，试炼已行至终点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是迷宫的最深处，米诺陶的居所，最后的考验所在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雾气之中，一道闪烁的轮廓逐渐鲜明起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先是一位智者，一个士兵。一个国王，一个农夫。一个孩子，一个老人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，它逐渐定型，化为一个笑容尖锐的年轻女人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……妈妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你为什么在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幻影发出了一声轻笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>不，我的孩子，我不是你所想之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我只是一个影子，一抹火光，一个投射于你眼前的幻象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>因为有限无法度量无限。你可怜的感官无法想象出未曾见过之物，也无法理解从未聆听之声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我是你惶然的祈求，你得见天光之前的狱卒，你的困惑投于水面的倒影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>——我是上一个发声者驻足的回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可你看起来就是妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37惊异地呼喊着，不自觉地上前了一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我已经到了试炼的最后一关，我来到了真理的门前，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>而你在这儿，也就意味着，你真的抵达了超验的天国——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-306610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我的猜想没有错，我们的模型也没有输，是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>……天国？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人突然奇异地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我的女儿，你在说什么？难道你把我说的话都当了真不成？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>傻孩子……多么可爱的傻孩子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上前的脚步停止了，37错愕地抬起了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那对碧色眼眸的神情不改，熟悉依旧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>可是，你真的从未怀疑过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>你不也动摇过一瞬吗？当你夜晚独自漫步在沙滩上，目光无可避免地触及那些几何体时……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>“如果它们真的是超验世界的象征，那我为何无法在这些碎块中分辨出妈妈的数字？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>“我为何听不到她的声音？我为何看不到这其中的规律？我的眼前一片漆黑！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>“——妈妈，我很想你！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-306613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>唉！我可怜的、可爱的女儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>你太年幼，太天真，太眷恋亲人的臂弯和脚下熟悉的土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>不然你本该继续怀疑下去，而非沿袭我架设的陈旧道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>那个猜想错了吗？那个模型对了吗？这并不重要，因为游戏规则已经改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>制造混乱之人，扰乱局势之人，重塑规则之人，他们走在了前列。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我们并非错了，只是落后了。我们被名为天国的幻梦遮蔽，反而丧失了刺穿现实的能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>但是没关系，我的女儿，因为你还是到这儿来了，这比任何事都重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我们又能一起计算，比任何一次都将做得更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>妈妈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她微笑着拨拢额发，朝眼前的少女伸出手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>这世界是一个巨大的废墟，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>而占据其中的多数造物，那些沉默、拥塞、行色匆匆的芸芸众生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>他们此生从未抬头仰望过一次星空，从未俯身嗅闻过一次花香，从未聆听过那至高音律的一次鸣响，从未让心灵的琴弦为此颤栗过一秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>他们受困于躯体的坟墓，沉沦于感官的坟茔，却自以为能用暴力统治这颗星球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>他们嘲笑我们，背弃我们，屠杀我们，放逐我们至历史的边缘，视我们为胡言乱语的疯子，我们挚爱的一切为无价值的垃圾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>——可我们从未放弃，也从未真正被打垮。因为他们是错的，他们总有一天会知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我的女儿，我最珍贵的海贝里的珍珠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>来吧，到妈妈这儿来，让我们回到争论和灾难之前，回到只有你、我与数字证明的海滩上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>我将分享于你无穷无尽的奥秘，万事万物的本质，超越一切的真理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>你正是为了它到这儿来的，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的目光真诚而热烈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37走上台阶，几乎就要握住那双温暖的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后，她抬起头，困惑地问出了一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>可是，妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我的数字是37，不是无穷大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我为什么要知道无穷无尽的奥秘呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-515711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-515711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a5/HeadIconSmall-515711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">77？：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_shiliandi4\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_shiliandi4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandi4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这股震动是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是37回答错误了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蜃景突然变得有所不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洞穴内壁无故卷起了飓风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那风暴的中心，37仰起头，目光越过了母亲的幻影，径直望向空中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_37wentian1\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_37wentian1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我不想知道无穷的奥秘，这不是我的数字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我知道，我是37，仅是37，一个有限的数字，沙滩上一粒微小的石头，海潮随时可以没过我，摧毁我，碾碎我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>即便如此，我也为此骄傲！因为我知晓自己的有限——而所有伟大的存在都对此一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的幻影逐渐破裂，那些几何体的碎片闪烁着微弱的辉光，如同呼吸的起伏。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_37wentian3\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_37wentian3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四周的风声愈发巨大，气流吹起长发，几乎让她睁不开眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她仍勉力挣扎着，不屈地站立着。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_37wentian1\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_37wentian1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_37wentian1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>无限定者，我来只是想询问一个简单的问题！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-306601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——我们如何才能不受现象世界的黑暗所绊，一劳永逸地自灵性的“流溢”中幸免！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_shiliandizhongxin1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清脆的声音如同投掷入水潭的石子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，从古老的岩壁上传来了回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>智慧的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——尊重限度之人，汝展现了足够的谦卑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>作为报偿，汝将得到所求之物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>————</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/HeadIconSmall-306614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……呃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>难以理解的异响，像是深海里的古老回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那不能被称为是规律的音节，它更像是层叠的岩壁共振的应声。仅仅是听到一个震颤，身体便像是被利刃穿刺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>呼吸变得粘滞，血液也从鼻腔中涌出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>致命的眩晕在颅骨内回荡，眼前的一切都变成了重影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306617.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306617.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>怎么会，无限定者明明同意了分享答案——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306617.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306617.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>难道这个问题的解答……这个超越的真理……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306617.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306617.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cc/HeadIconSmall-306617.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306617.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>——是我们无法承受的吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>……快让开，让开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>露西女士，这个读法是对的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>您拿给我的纸条是正确的，这就是这个术式使用的神秘学语言！您究竟是从哪里拿到了它——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很好，把它给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们需要告诉科算中心全体，“暴雨”研究正式进入下一阶段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斩钉截铁的脚步穿过一排排透明的玻璃房间，抵达了“暴雨”研究与观测的主控室。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>联络员正在操作台前忙碌，新消息通过电信号与气动管道被传递到科算中心的各个科室。工作进程比血液更为流畅，一切都井然有序地进行着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为心脏中未被及时代谢掉的部分，一位擅离职守的前研究员也在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>如果您是来询问进度的——那很遗憾，所有小组都没有进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您恐怕是要白跑一趟了，露西女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器并不会为这种程度的讥讽所动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走到临时的联络员前，递出了那枚鸽子带来的纸条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>将这个发送出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>验证通过了，这就是免疫“暴雨”术式的正确读法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……？！你说这个就是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>掌心微微颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这张狭窄的纸条远比它看起来要沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸条半摊着，借由上方标注的念法，他读出了第一个单词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-512912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>La unua ...</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸条被拿走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>联络员走了过来，她的动作同样因为欣喜而颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络员Ⅰ：</div><div>我们得赶快把它告诉所有人——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎是一路小跑到机器前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸条在屏幕上摊开，联络员紧张地核实着，确保自己不会遗漏这重要咒语的任何一个细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-516112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络员Ⅰ：</div><div>La unua ... cirklo ...</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>读写一致。她按下了发送键，欣悦地转过身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">联络员Ⅰ：</div><div>……唔……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无征兆，她的身体逐渐开裂。然后成片的碎屑落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>什么——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地狱在这一刻降临了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>慌乱后退的脚步和地板发出尖锐的摩擦声，有人惊慌地把咖啡打翻在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>总负责人伫立在原地，但条屏仍震惊地闪烁着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>快终止传输！！这个术式有问题！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这一时刻，需要有人能基于现实运转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不，术式没有问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——它的确是正确的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-09"}}